{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】本港地區今日(10月18日)天氣預測，大致多雲。早上有一兩陣微雨。日間部分時間有陽光及乾燥，最高氣溫約31度。吹和緩至清勁東風，初時高地間中吹強風。</p><p>展望未來兩三日天晴乾燥，星期三日間酷熱。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T23:38:59.628398+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T23:16:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:57:54.733734+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T23:37:44.384746+00:00","content_hash":"84cf3a0613b6050cb38488fa7152fbd23b7eb736af5dade9209f74519fd907b2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}